        {
          "resource_id": "monster_trait",
          "stats": {
            "trait_name": {
              "value": "Mystery Ingredients"
            },
            "trait_description": {
              "value": "(auditory, aura, occult)\n\n60 feet. Creatures in the aura take a \u20132 status penalty to checks to Identify Alchemy, Recall Knowledge about alchemical subjects, or examine snake oil effects. When a creature first enters the area, if it hears the ichor slinger talking, it must attempt a secret Will save against the slinger's Deception DC. On a failure, it treats its next failed check to Identify Alchemy or Recall Knowledge about alchemical subjects in the next 24 hours as though it were a critical failure instead. This is an auditory misfortune effect."
            },
